Beach Ball Boogey includes a small adaptation of cube-player construction and movement-vector normalization from:

Soccer_ThreeJS
Copyright (c) 2025 unknown11-svg
Source: https://github.com/unknown11-svg/Soccer_ThreeJS/blob/d96313359611303e0ba1a47fdc2402fdb9957d23/main.js
Inspected revision: d96313359611303e0ba1a47fdc2402fdb9957d23
Adapted portions: `createPlayer` cube placeholder construction and the `updatePlayer` movement-vector normalization pattern, in `src/render/scene.ts` and `src/game/movement.ts`.
Changes: reduced cube proportions for the foot-tennis court; moved all position/facing data into logical TypeScript state; changed frame-based motion to fixed-step units-per-second movement; normalized and clamped the user's near half-court movement; added render interpolation and a separate facing marker.

